        "sourceItemId": "seed-nasa-water-cycle-item"
      },
      {
        "id": "science-fact-3",
        "statement": "水蒸氣冷卻凝結成雲，之後以雨或雪回到地表。",
        "sourceItemId": "seed-nasa-water-cycle-item"
      }
